
---

# Common `.gitignore`

Use the same `.gitignore` in **all four repositories**:

```gitignore
# Vivado
.vivado/
*.jou
*.log
*.str
*.xpr
*.runs/
*.cache/
*.gen/
*.hw/
*.ip_user_files/
*.sim/
*.srcs/
*.Xil/

# Generated FPGA files
*.bit
*.bin
*.ltx
*.dcp

# Icarus Verilog
*.vvp
*.vcd
*.fst

# GTKWave
*.gtkw

# Temporary files
*.tmp
*.temp
*.bak
*~

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# VS Code
.vscode/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Build directories
build/
dist/
out/